(7307675, 1139803, 90947, '<td valign="top">Little wonder you got first place.  Not only wonderfully imagined and beautifully crafted, but right on target to respond to recent events.  <br/> <br/>I really have no idea where the 3 one''s came from, and really anything less than 10. <br/> <br/>Absolutely superb. I think the French to buy it in 260 cm by 325 cm size.</td>', 'Little wonder you got first place.  Not only wonderfully imagined and beautifully crafted, but right on target to respond to recent events.   I really have no idea where the 3 one''s came from, and really anything less than 10.  Absolutely superb. I think the French to buy it in 260 cm by 325 cm size.', '2015-01-28 16:35:19.000000', NULL, 0),
